WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.510
A car is driving along
a straight, dry road.

2
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.750
The driver spots a hazard,
brakes hard, and the car stops.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.210
Now run it again: the
same car, the same brakes,

4
00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.160
but going twice as fast.

5
00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.740
Twice the speed.

6
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.370
Twice the braking distance?

7
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.050
More?

8
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.060
Less?

9
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.260
In this mission, you'll link the work
done by the overall force to the change

10
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.770
in kinetic energy.

11
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.460
Then you'll work out the net work done
on a child on a toboggan as it slows down

12
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.200
across level snow.

13
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.140
Your mission: predict how much
longer the braking distance gets,

14
00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:35.470
and explain why.
